{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0230","name":"王凤","evidence":["wudi-q-o104"],"facts":[{"id":"wudi-f-b-70f246fe2f08c95f642c-wudi-p0230-c55038","label":"字","text":"孝卿","evidence":["wudi-q-b-70f246fe2f08c95f642c"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"孝卿","evidence":["wudi-q-b-70f246fe2f08c95f642c"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o104-wudi-p0230","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o104"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-70f246fe2f08c95f642c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-70f246fe2f08c95f642c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖9〗王凤（？—前 22）：字孝卿，东平陵（今山东济南市东）人。西汉成帝时以外戚的关系担任大司马、大将军、领尚书事，专擅朝政。谷永：字子云，长安人。王凤专权，大树同党，引起舆论指责。而谷永为了巴结，反而上书朝廷，说王凤“有申伯之忠”。传见《汉书》卷八十五。申伯：西周王室的外戚。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":588,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9e439d7713a1c5d6364e","start":0,"end":139,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o104","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8efba5dafb5dd32d0163","layer":"original","quote":"九月，令曰：“阿党比周〖4〗，先圣所疾也〖5〗。闻冀州俗：父子异部更相毁誉〖6〗。昔直不疑无兄，世人谓之盗嫂〖7〗；第五伯鱼三娶孤女，谓之挝妇翁〖8〗；王凤擅权，谷永比之申伯〖9〗；王商忠议，张匡谓之左道〖10〗。此皆以白为黑，欺天罔君者也〖11〗。吾欲整齐风俗；四者不除〖12〗，吾以为羞！”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":576,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
